8e) Quasi-static, weak-compressibility candidate (not forced): ∇·v_brane ≈ S_brane/ρ0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
\nabla\cdot v_{\rm brane} = \frac{S_{\rm brane}}{\rho_{0}}
