8f) If v_L = ∇φ3 is the longitudinal part, then ∇²φ3 = ∇·v_brane ⇒ ρ0 ∇²φ3 ≈ S_brane
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
\nabla^{2 \phi}_{3} \rho_{0} = S_{\rm brane}
