8j-note) If v_i(t,x,y,z,w) is effectively w-independent (or a single separable mode), then Π_{ij}=ρ_brane v_i v_j and R_{ij}→0; otherwise R_{ij} encodes extra brane physics.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
